msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "Ban wormhole research"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1542
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "I just can't stand wormholes, or their researchers!"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1545
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "Heros for the ages"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1546
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "Their reputation is unmatched"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1549
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "Grand Slam"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1550
msgctxt "adminStnEndTips-comms"
msgid "You can do it, but can you do it ALL?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1554
msgctxt "adminStnEnd-comms"
msgid "Click here to lance the champagne!"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1555
msgctxt "adminStnEnd-comms"
msgid "Booyah!!!"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1563
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid ""
"We are the station that co-ordinates research activities in the nearby "
"nebulae.\n"
"\n"
"If you're not busy, please drop by to learn more about our projects."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1567
#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1581
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "Please bring our researchers home!"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1569
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid ""
"Thanks so much for finding our researchers! Dock with us if you'd like to "
"chat."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1574
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "We are so glad to have you aboard. What can we help you with?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1575
#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1589
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "How long have you been operating in this system?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1576
#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1593
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "Where is the colony where your researchers live?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1577
#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1597
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "Tell us about the nearby nebulae."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1578
#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1603
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "Are there any Kraylor in the area?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1579
#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1607
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "Are there any Exuari in the area?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1583
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "Always a pleasure to have you as our honoured guests."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1585
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "Any idea where we can get a Hawking Scanner fixed?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1586
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid ""
"Dr. Hendrix, who you rescued earlier, is the leading expert on those "
"scanners."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1590
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "We have been operating here for about 50 years"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1594
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "You'll find it to the east of the nebulae"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1598
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid ""
"Well I suppose you already know about the nebulae. They are to the north.\n"
"\n"
"Did you know that it's a popular place to hunt for treasure?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1604
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid ""
"We see some from time to time, but with the non-aggression treaty, they "
"haven't been too much trouble."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1608
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid ""
"Old space junk, mostly. We haven't seen any real Exauri activity in decades."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1617
msgctxt "found-comms"
msgid ""
"Come in? Dr. Hendrix here... Come in?\n"
"\n"
"Oh thank heavens, we're found! We thought we might be stuck here for good!\n"
"\n"
"We need to install a new hyperplasma full bridge rectifier, but our plasma "
"conduit driver has gone missing. You must have one in your engine room? If "
"you let us borrow it, we will upgrade your sensors with our new experimental "
"modifications."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1622
msgctxt "found-comms"
msgid "Sure, you can borrow our conduit driver!"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1623
msgctxt "found-comms"
msgid ""
"Great. Your sensors are upgraded. We'll get this rectifier installed and be "
"on our way.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks again, Captain. If you ever need some help with your Hawking "
"Scanners, look me up!"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1631
msgctxt "found-comms"
msgid "Thanks so much for finding us!"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1636
msgctxt "investigate-comms"
msgid "What do you have to say for yourself?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1637
msgctxt "investigate-comms"
msgid "We're just running a salvage mission."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1638
msgctxt "investigate-comms"
msgid "Carry on, then, we're keeping our eye on you."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1640
msgctxt "investigate-comms"
msgid "Back off, this is a special military operation"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1641
msgctxt "investigate-comms"
msgid "You want to back up that escalation with some weapons fire?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1647
msgctxt "drone-comms"
msgid ""
"We oversee the B-3 liquidation of the Ghosts assets.\n"
"\n"
"Dock with us to check out what we've got."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1651
msgctxt "drone-comms"
msgid ""
"You need any of this stuff?\n"
"\n"
"It's not for sale, as such. You'll need to get a requisition from the Admin "
"Station in order to carry anything out.\n"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1655
msgctxt "drone-comms"
msgid "Proximity Sensor"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1656
msgctxt "drone-comms"
msgid "Activates when ships get too close"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1659
msgctxt "drone-comms"
msgid "Intelligence Accelerator"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1660
msgctxt "drone-comms"
msgid "Too expensive to use for video games."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1663
msgctxt "drone-comms"
msgid "Graviton Lens"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1666
msgctxt "drone-comms"
msgid ""
"Ooooh, a requisition!\n"
"\n"
"Alright, enjoy... focusing your gravitons, I guess!"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1670
msgctxt "drone-comms"
msgid "For focusing the gravitational field."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1674
msgctxt "drone-comms"
msgid "Holographic Projector"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1675
msgctxt "drone-comms"
msgid "Shows very convincing drone stations"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1684
#, lua-format
msgctxt "attack-incCall"
msgid ""
"HELP!\n"
"We are taking damage from %s and might need assistance."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1688
#, lua-format
msgctxt "attack-shipLog"
msgid "%s is taking damage!"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1715
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid ""
"Sorry to interrupt, but we've just recieved an urgent call.\n"
"\n"
"It seems one of our researchers, Dr. Hendrix, and her crew have lost their "
"way in a nearby nebula and need our help. They were running experiments in "
"the nebula when their engines and transponder went offline. Please follow "
"our scout vessel, SR7, to the nebula and search for them."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1723
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "Meet me at the edge of the nebula"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1741
msgctxt "adminStn-incCall"
msgid ""
"Ready to head in?\n"
"\n"
"The nebula is very thick, so we will need to get close to find a ship with "
"no transponder. Probes won't show the ship, but your relay station should be "
"able to pick it up at 20U or less. There may be hazards, so be careful.\n"
"\n"
"I'll follow you. Let's find Dr. Hendrix and bring her crew home."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1746
msgctxt "adminStn-shipLog"
msgid "Fly into the Nebula and find Dr. Hendrix"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1769
msgctxt "finishMissionNebulae-shipLog"
msgid "Sensors have been upgraded."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1811
msgctxt "defenceStn-comms"
msgid ""
"Great!\n"
"\n"
"Start at the checkpoint in the North West. You'll need to dock at each "
"station before proceeding to the next."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1842
#, lua-format
msgctxt "defenceStn-incCall"
msgid "Please proceed to %s"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1843
#, lua-format
msgctxt "defenceStn-shipLog"
msgid "Please proceed to %s"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1862
msgctxt "defenceStn-incCall"
msgid ""
"Great work captain!\n"
"\n"
"You have repelled the attackers and the SW Checkpoint is safe for now, but "
"intelligence reports show a huge drone convoy in your vicinity to the NW.\n"
"\n"
"INVESTIGATE BUT DO NOT ENGAGE! We have it on good word that attacking this "
"convoy is extremely risky. Keep your distance, but we'd like to know where "
"they are going."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1867
msgctxt "defenceStn-shipLog"
msgid "Investigate the convoy, but DO NOT ENGAGE"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1897
msgctxt "defenceStn-incCall"
msgid ""
"Come in, Captain.\n"
"We have the info we need about that convoy and strongly discourage any "
"further engagement.\n"
"Your assistance is required with a secret mission. Dock with us to receive "
"further instructions when you're ready."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1898
msgctxt "defenceStn-shipLog"
msgid "Dock with the Defence Station to start another mission"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1941
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "and when in doubt - apply missiles."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1943
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "and we've given you some extra missiles to help get the job done."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1946
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid "and go find some extra missiles to help get the job done."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1949
#, lua-format
msgctxt "wormhole-comms"
msgid ""
"Great!\n"
"There is an old Exuari station, callsign X472, to the SE on the other side "
"of the wormhole. It used to study the planet forming nearby, but it's been "
"abandoned for over a century now, no one aboard and no weapons, a historical "
"relic, really. We need you to demolish it and bring us the stabilizers from "
"its jump drive which we can use to maintain our Hawking Scanners.\n"
"We have hacked the emergency integrity field so that the station can be "
"destroyed, but there were strange disturbances when we deactivated it. We're "
"not sure what it means, but we advise you to exercise caution...\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1966
msgctxt "KraylorWarning-incCall"
msgid ""
"Ugh, humans.\n"
"\n"
"This is the Kraylor Advanced \"Reasearch\" Project Agency (KARPA), we have "
"detected your suspicious activity in the vicinity.\n"
"\n"
"We are sending a team to investigate what you are up to. If you fire on us, "
"there will be trouble!"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1971
msgctxt "KraylorWarning-shipLog"
msgid ""
"The Kraylor are investigating our activities and have warned us not to "
"escalate"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1977
msgctxt "wormhole-incCall"
msgid ""
"Great, you got the parts!\n"
"\n"
"You'd better hurry back, we've seen some Kraylor activity in the area. "
"Hopefully your salvage mission didn't attract the wrong sort of attention."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1981
msgctxt "wormhole-shipLog"
msgid "Return the spare parts to the Wormhole Station"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:1993
msgctxt "wormhole-shipLog"
msgid "Jump Defence Activated"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2018
msgctxt "KraylorWarning-incCall"
msgid ""
"Watch your back, Hugh Mon!\n"
"\n"
"We don't know what you're up to, but we don't like the look of it. Keep your "
"distance and maybe we'll leave you alone.\n"
"\n"
"<The Kraylor Vessel jumps back through the wormhole>"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2023
msgctxt "KraylorWarning-shipLog"
msgid "The Kraylor seem hostile and have warned us to keep our distance"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2054
msgctxt "defenceStn-comms"
msgid "Good luck"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2086
msgctxt "defenceStn-incCall"
msgid "Arrived, scan the security beacons"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2090
msgctxt "defenceStn-incCall"
msgid ""
"Your cover has been blown and the proximity defence system remains active. "
"We suggest leaving and trying again to arrive with a future convoy."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2091
msgctxt "defenceStn-shipLog"
msgid "Our cover has been blown"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2096
msgctxt "defenceStn-shipLog"
msgid "We should be good to try again"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2130
msgctxt "drone-incCall"
msgid ""
"Great work, Captain!\n"
"\n"
"We have taken control of this station and will be liquidating spare parts "
"from the wreckage."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2133
msgctxt "drone-shipLog"
msgid "DB-3 has a collection of spare parts"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2212
msgctxt "wormhole-incCall"
msgid ""
"Thanks so much, captain!\n"
"\n"
"You really saved our ass there. Unfortunately our Hawking Scanner was "
"damaged by the bomb, and we haven't been able to get it back online. Do you "
"think you could get it fixed for us?\n"
"\n"
"Please dock with us to pick up the scanner."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2217
msgctxt "wormhole-shipLog"
msgid "Get the Hawking Scanner from the Wormhole Station"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2272
msgctxt "drone-shipLog"
msgid ""
"This ship will not activate the drone station proximity defences as long as "
"you arrive with a convoy."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2276
msgctxt "drone-shipLog"
msgid "It's nice to be back aboard the Propitious 1"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2309
msgctxt "drone-incCall"
msgid "PROXIMITY DEFENCE SYSTEM ACTIVATED"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2310
msgctxt "drone-shipLog"
msgid "We got too close to a drone station and it launched defences."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2321
msgctxt "scienceDescription-beacons"
msgid ""
"The Ghosts drone security beacons. If we scan them all, we should be able to "
"find the control station. We'll need to get pretty close."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2329
msgctxt "scienceDescription-beacons"
msgid ""
"The beamforming configuration from this beacon will help the boffins "
"triangulate the location of the central control."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2338
#, lua-format
msgctxt "defenceStn-incCall"
msgid ""
"Great work!\n"
"Our boffins were able to piece together the data and figure out where the "
"commands are coming from.\n"
"You must destroy station %s"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2339
#, lua-format
msgctxt "defenceStn-shipLog"
msgid "The drone control station is %s"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2410
msgctxt "newShip-comms"
msgid "Too busy to talk today, Captain."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2419
msgctxt "hendrixHints-comms"
msgid "Sorry, I don't know where Dr. Hendrix lives"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2427
#, lua-format
msgctxt "hendrixHints-comms"
msgid ""
"Dr. Hendrix, of course! I'm pretty sure she was on a %s-class station, but "
"darned if I can remember which one."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2429
#, lua-format
msgctxt "hendrixHints-comms"
msgid ""
"Gosh, Dr. Hendrix. Okay. Sorry, but honestly all I remember is that her "
"address definitely has a '%s' in it."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2436
msgctxt "defeat-shipLog"
msgid "DEFEAT - A Patrol Station has been destroyed"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2443
msgctxt "defeat-shipLog"
msgid "DEFEAT - A Core station (Admin, Defence, Wormhole) has been destroyed"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2450
msgctxt "defeat-shipLog"
msgid "DEFEAT - Station B-3 has been destroyed"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2538
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "SUCCESS!!!"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_30_brokenglass.lua:2540
msgctxt "adminStn-comms"
msgid "INCOMPLETE"
msgstr ""
